---
title: "What belongs on a home card?"
accTitle: "Home card layers versus the note body"
accDescr: "A compact identity stack sits in the title slot. Catalogs, Tasks, and the project task stay in the note body."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph CARD["Title slot"]
    direction TB
    K["`**Kicker**<br/>AREA or PROJECT · parent`"]
    T["`**Title**<br/>H1, else humanized stem`"]
    S["`**Subtitle**<br/>summary or ^prj criterion`"]
    P["`**Chips**<br/>only authored policy`"]
    F["`**Foot**<br/>Properties · created`"]
    K --> T --> S --> P --> F
  end
  subgraph BODY["Body of the note"]
    direction TB
    C["`**Catalogs**<br/>Areas, Projects, Notebooks, Albums`"]
    R["`**Residence**<br/>Tasks and the ^prj line`"]
    C --> R
  end
  F -.->|"does not copy"| C
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  class K,T focus
  class S,P,F outcome
  class C,R muted
  style CARD fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style BODY fill:none,stroke:#6B7280
